WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Email an appointment to someone.

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:06.633
Open an appointment. Click any appointment.

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:23.433
Email it. Sends the details to anyone: when, the customer, their phone and address, and the notes. Click it and a small form opens: the address to send it to, a note from you if you like (Can you cover this one?), and Send. It is logged on the appointment.

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:29.533
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
